<title>UK: Edge sells site to Scottish Amicable.</title>
<headline>Edge sells site to Scottish Amicable.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>British real estate group Edge Properties Plc said on Friday it had sold a retail warehouse in Darlington, north England, to Scottish Amicable for 3.45 million stg.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
